## What changed THIS session

1. **Strict eslint gate** (user request): eslint 9 + angular-eslint
   20.7 flat config; pre-commit check 11/11 blocks on ANY problem; CI
   lint step fails-on-error; pre-commit check 4 now runs the PRODUCTION
   build (tsc alone cannot see template type errors). ~112 findings
   fixed (a11y labels/keyboard, output renames close→closed,
