   by the orchestrator. New repo skill:
   `.agents/skills/angular-lint-gate/SKILL.md`.
2. **Backend-switch readiness**: login persists the token to TokenStore
   (Bearer now flows to the real gateway after login); mock seed gained
   `POST /auth/register` + `POST /auth/login/2fa` (29→31 routes); pool
   KPI money formatted via formatApiMoney and the withdraw modal shows
   the MEMBER balance (ApiClient.balance()) not pool totals; E-1036
   seed ETA is relative to now ('ETA 4 days' stable); stale e2e
   assertions updated to one-source values.
3. **Pack E hygiene**: `_placeholder` deleted, `/showcase` gated out of
